cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its coded data, please cite it as below."
title: "world-impact: an uncertainty-aware, multi-criteria basis for ranking world-historical developments"
abstract: >-
  A coded matrix of documented world-historical developments against 18 outcome
  domains, with axes derived rather than assumed, measurement uncertainty
  propagated from an ordinal graded-response model through to a stochastic
  multi-criteria ranking, two nested null models for the structure claim, and an
  enabling graph for mediated effects. Ships its own negative results, including
  a demonstrable ceiling in the coding rubric and a retracted effective-rank
  claim.
type: software
